# src/apps/android/app/src/main/java/com/luminet/android/dns

## Purpose
Owns Android-specific DNS configuration and resolution integration used by LumiNet networking flows.

## Contents
Contains Kotlin/Java DNS helpers, models, and platform adapters used by the Android application and tunnel stack.

## Interfaces and dependencies
Interacts with Android networking/platform APIs and is consumed by app or tunnel components that apply DNS behavior.

## Invariants
DNS state must be validated before application, lifecycle cleanup must not leave stale platform state, and routing/resolution changes must respect active tunnel ownership.